bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823200/extras/e11aba9fa4fe0480a1ea0035abcf7063.poster.avif?t=1727089039\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823200/extras/e11aba9fa4fe0480a1ea0035abcf7063.webm?t=1727089039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823200/extras/e11aba9fa4fe0480a1ea0035abcf7063.mp4?t=1727089039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823200/extras/dfad5f77638854f2ef10f7a4546d985c.webp?t=1727089039\" width=615 height=54 /></span><br><br>The quest to recover the Jewel of Jumanji has evolved. If you want to get home, go big with adventure! Quest alone or in local multiplayer for up to four explorers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823200/extras/04aa63ccfc4d91a9fa35993e81cb1592.poster.avif?t=1727089039\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823200/extras/04aa63ccfc4d91a9fa35993e81cb1592.webm?t=1727089039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823200/extras/04aa63ccfc4d91a9fa35993e81cb1592.mp4?t=1727089039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 3 1200 /Intel Core i3-7100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon RX 550 4GB / Nvidia GTX 750<br></li><li><